### createSession → 201 CreatedSession（code は実 GitHub か e2e モックから取る。未設定なら 403 /problems/forbidden）
# @name createSession
POST {{host}}/auth/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "admin", "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/auth/github/callback"}

### current → 200 Session（直前の createSession の token）
GET {{host}}/auth/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{createSession.response.body.token}}

### current (no token) → 401 Problem type=/problems/unauthorized
GET {{host}}/auth/sessions/current

### current (garbage) → 401 Problem type=/problems/unauthorized
GET {{host}}/auth/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer garbage

### logout → 204（2 回目は 401。frontend は成功扱い）
DELETE {{host}}/auth/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{createSession.response.body.token}}

### createSession (empty code) → 400 Problem type=/problems/validation-failed
POST {{host}}/auth/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "", "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/auth/github/callback"}
